## 1. Membership form → athletes record

**Why it matters:** The coach app Members section is empty until this is done.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Form[membership_forms row inserted] --> Parse[Parse payload_json]
    Parse --> Fields[first_name + last_name\ndob\nemergency_contact_name + mobile\nmedical_info]
    Fields --> Insert[INSERT INTO athletes\nenquiry_id membership_form_id]
    Insert --> Event[appendEnquiryEvent\nmembership_form_submitted]
    Insert --> Coach[Visible on coach\nregister next session]
```

Files to change: membership form submission handler in `src/api/` or `src/pages/join.astro`. No schema changes needed — `athletes` table exists from migration 0004.

---

## 2. Admin cookie hardening

Move `egac_admin_token` from JavaScript `document.cookie` to a `Set-Cookie` response header:

```
Set-Cookie: egac_admin_token=<token>; Path=/admin; HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=Strict; Max-Age=86400
```

Prevents XSS from accessing the session cookie.

---

## 3. Pastoral care cron

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Cron[Weekly cron\nMonday 09:00] --> Query[Find athletes WHERE\nlast_attended_at < 21 days ago\nAND previously attending]
    Query --> Flag[flagged_absent = 1\nflagged_absent_at = now]
    Flag --> Email[Admin digest:\nN athletes missing 3+ weeks]
```

Turns attendance data into a safeguarding signal automatically.

